@cost_monitor
Feature: 雲端與 AI 成本監控中心 # tests/features/33-成本監控中心.feature:2
  說明：Super Admin 專屬的成本可視化與預算告警中心。
  整合 Anthropic Admin API、Gemini / Voyage 應用層 token tracking、
  GCP BigQuery Billing Export，提供即時用量、趨勢與多層級預算告警。
  一般 admin 不可見此頁面。
  @cost_monitor
  Feature: 雲端與 AI 成本監控中心  # tests/features/33-成本監控中心.feature:2

  Rule: 前置 - 僅 super_admin 可存取成本監控 API  # tests/features/33-成本監控中心.feature:30

    Example: super_admin 成功取得當月成本總覽           # tests/features/33-成本監控中心.feature:32
      Given 系統中有以下使用者帳號：                      # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/users.py:64
        | 使用者 ID | Email               | 訂閱方案       | 角色          |
        | 1      | super@certimate.com | ULTRA_1599 | super_admin |
        | 2      | ops@certimate.com   | ULTRA_1599 | admin       |
        | 3      | user@certimate.com  | PRO_199    | user        |
      And 系統中有以下預算設定：                         # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/aggregate_given/budget_config.py:35
        | scope        | monthly_limit_usd | warning_percent | degrade_percent | disable_percent |
        | AI_ANTHROPIC | 500               | 50              | 80              | 100             |
        | AI_GEMINI    | 300               | 50              | 80              | 100             |
        | AI_VOYAGE    | 50                | 50              | 80              | 100             |
        | GCP_TOTAL    | 2000              | 50              | 80              | 100             |
      And 當月累計用量為：                            # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/aggregate_given/current_usage.py:37
        | scope        | current_usd |
        | AI_ANTHROPIC | 120.50      |
        | AI_GEMINI    | 85.20       |
        | AI_VOYAGE    | 10.00       |
        | GCP_TOTAL    | 450.75      |
      When 使用者 "super@certimate.com" 查看成本監控總覽 # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/commands/view_endpoints.py:12
      Then 操作成功                               # tests/features/steps/common_then/success.py:4
      And 回應應包含各 scope 的當月金額：                 # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/readmodel_then/response_fields.py:15
        | scope        | current_usd | limit_usd | percent |
        | AI_ANTHROPIC | 120.50      | 500       | 24.10   |
        | AI_GEMINI    | 85.20       | 300       | 28.40   |
        | AI_VOYAGE    | 42.00       | 150       | 28.00   |
        | GCP_TOTAL    | 450.75      | 2000      | 22.54   |

