        | GCP_TOTAL    | 450.75      |
      Given 當月 Gemini 累計用量為 240 USD                # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/aggregate_given/current_usage.py:62
      When 系統執行預算檢查                                # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/commands/internal_actions.py:103
      Then 應寫入 budget_alert_log 記錄一筆 "DEGRADE" 告警  # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/aggregate_then/db_assertions.py:183
      And AI 功能狀態應為 "degraded"                     # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/aggregate_then/db_assertions.py:210
      And 使用者 "user@certimate.com" 嘗試生成新考題時應被拒絕    # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/readmodel_then/misc_then.py:73
      And 錯誤代碼為 "AI_BUDGET_DEGRADED"               # tests/features/steps/common_then/error_code.py:27
      And 使用者 "user@certimate.com" 仍可瀏覽既有的 AI 生成內容 # tests/features/steps/cost_monitor/aggregate_then/db_assertions.py:260

