      Given 系統有一個科目 "AWS SAA" 含 1 個知識節點 "S3"           # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/setup_nodes_and_chunks.py:149
      And 該節點關聯 3 個 resource_chunks                    # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/setup_nodes_and_chunks.py:169
      And 使用者 "learner@certimate.com" 尚未有任何 mastery 紀錄 # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/setup_nodes_and_chunks.py:141
      When 系統以使用者身份查詢與 "物件儲存" 相關的 chunks               # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/commands/direct_service_calls.py:8
      Then 檢索結果應包含所有 "S3" 節點的 chunks                   # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_then/assertions.py:35

  Rule: 後置（狀態）- 新節點的 support_strength 預設應為 0.0 (尚未測量)  # tests/features/34-心智圖架構升級.feature:40

