      And 候選池只有 3 個 chunks              # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/rerank_schema_setup.py:52
      When 系統請求 top_k=5 的檢索             # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/commands/rerank_schema_commands.py:10
      Then 系統不應呼叫 Voyage rerank API     # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_then/rerank_schema_assertions.py:6
      And 應返回全部 3 個候選                   # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_then/rerank_schema_assertions.py:12

    Example: Voyage 配額達到 degrade 時 rerank fallback 至純 pgvector  # tests/features/34-心智圖架構升級.feature:115
      Given 系統中有以下使用者帳號：                                        # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/users.py:64
        | 使用者 ID | Email                 | 訂閱方案       | 角色          |
        | 1      | super@certimate.com   | ULTRA_1599 | super_admin |
        | 2      | learner@certimate.com | PRO_199    | user        |
      Given RetrievalService 已啟用 rerank                         # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/rerank_schema_setup.py:46
      And 候選池有 10 個 chunks                                      # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/rerank_schema_setup.py:71
      And Voyage AI 當月用量達 degrade 門檻                            # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/rerank_schema_setup.py:76
      When 系統請求 top_k=3 的檢索                                     # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/commands/rerank_schema_commands.py:10
      Then rerank 應被跳過                                          # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_then/rerank_schema_assertions.py:18
      And 應返回 pgvector 前 3 個候選                                  # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_then/rerank_schema_assertions.py:24

    Example: Rerank API 失敗時靜默 fallback  # tests/features/34-心智圖架構升級.feature:123
      Given 系統中有以下使用者帳號：                # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/users.py:64
        | 使用者 ID | Email                 | 訂閱方案       | 角色          |
        | 1      | super@certimate.com   | ULTRA_1599 | super_admin |
        | 2      | learner@certimate.com | PRO_199    | user        |
      Given RetrievalService 已啟用 rerank # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/rerank_schema_setup.py:46
      And 候選池有 10 個 chunks              # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/rerank_schema_setup.py:71
      And Voyage rerank API 會拋出例外       # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_given/rerank_schema_setup.py:107
      When 系統請求 top_k=3 的檢索             # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/commands/rerank_schema_commands.py:10
      Then 應返回 pgvector 前 3 個候選         # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_then/rerank_schema_assertions.py:24
      And 系統應記錄 warning log             # tests/features/steps/mindmap_upgrade/aggregate_then/rerank_schema_assertions.py:33

